    "sample_id": "helpsteer3:train:0fd16310461a62786a5408043298576f49dd5d788137e1f57aa6f1b270bd0a02",
    "task": "{CHARACTER CONCEPT - OCEAN}\n\nWhile all the other Rainbow Friends were made by Red, there was one that was actually made by two other Rainbow Friends.\n\nOne day, Red noticed a strange new figure in the chamber that housed Orange and Cyan.\n\nAnd the new figure just so happened to be Ocean.\n\nOcean resembled a mix of her parents - Orange and Cyan.\n\nWhile Ocean inherited the sheer speed of her father - Orange - the strange ability to detect whenever somebody is moving that Ocean has was inherited from her mother - Cyan.\n\nAs the years went by, Ocean grew in size.\n\nFinally, on her 2nd birthday, Ocean was allowed to leave her chamber.",
    "chosen": "Ocean, a unique and intriguing addition to the Rainbow Friends, was a product of the unexpected collaboration between Orange and Cyan. With her distinctive appearance and abilities, she brought a fresh dynamic to the group.\n\nOcean's physical features were a delightful blend of her parents. She had the vibrant, fiery orange hue of her father, which was beautifully contrasted with the cool, soothing cyan tones of her mother. Her form was sleek and streamlined, much like Orange, but with the added grace and fluidity reminiscent of Cyan.\n\nHer abilities were equally impressive. Ocean inherited her father's incredible speed, making her one of the fastest Rainbow Friends. She could zip through the chambers and corridors with astonishing agility, leaving a trail of shimmering ocean-colored light in her wake. This speed, combined with her mother's unique ability to detect movement, made Ocean a formidable presence. She could sense the slightest movement within her vicinity, allowing her to react swiftly and strategically.\n\nAs Ocean grew, so did her curiosity and eagerness to explore beyond her chamber. On her second birthday, she was finally granted permission to venture out. This marked a significant milestone in her life and the beginning of a new chapter for the Rainbow Friends. Ocean's unique abilities and perspective promised to bring about exciting changes and adventures for the entire group.",
    "rejected": "{CHARACTER CONCEPT - OCEAN}\n\nWhile all the other Rainbow Friends were made by Red, there was one that was actually made by two other Rainbow Friends.\n\nOne day, Red noticed a strange new figure in the chamber that housed Orange and Cyan.\n\nAnd the new figure just so happened to be Ocean.\n\nOcean resembled a mix of her parents - Orange and Cyan.\n\nWhile Ocean inherited the sheer speed of her father - Orange - the strange ability to detect whenever somebody is moving that Ocean has was inherited from her mother - Cyan.\n\nAs the years went by, Ocean grew in size.\n\nFinally, on her 2nd birthday, Ocean was allowed to leave her chamber.",
